    "text": "Saudi company eyes $30 billion energy investment in Pakistan! ⚡\nAccording to Business Recorder, Delta Energy Saudi has signed an agreement with Pakistan's Inter State Gas Systems to explore about $30 billion of investment in Pakistan's energy infrastructure. The plan includes a natural gas pipeline from Pakistan's western border towards Gwadar, and possible LNG facilities, gas storage and export terminals. The agreement is a framework to evaluate the projects, not a final investment decision.\nCan this deal ease Pakistan's gas shortage? Tell us below 👇\n\nImage: AI-generated illustration.\n\n#RiseUpPakistan #Gwadar #SaudiArabia #PakistanEnergy #PakistanNews",
